   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": null,
   "text": "Calls served per second: 2.27 \u00b7 2.21 \u00b7 2.33 \u00b7 2.25 \u2014 the same at every depth. Capacity is the GPU's;\na queue decides whether the excess is refused now or waits. (Bound 64's p99 was a little lower than bound 8's: one run each.)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 35,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Calls served per second: 2.27 \u00b7 2.21 \u00b7 2.33 \u00b7 2.25 \u2014 the same at every depth. Capacity is the GPU's;\na queue decides whether the excess is refused now or waits. (Bound 64's p99 was a little lower than bound 8's: one run each.)",
   "lineHeight": 1.15
  },
